1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,342
Millions of photos and videos are copied,

2
00:00:03,422 --> 00:00:06,764
edited and re-posted as if they were
original.

3
00:00:06,844 --> 00:00:11,431
Creators don't get credit, newsrooms can't
tell what's real,

4
00:00:11,591 --> 00:00:14,620
and AI can now fake any image in seconds.

5
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:22,250
The question is simple: who published this
first, and how do we prove it?

6
00:00:22,410 --> 00:00:25,399
OriginProof answers that question.

7
00:00:25,559 --> 00:00:30,500
Upload a photo or video, and we compute

8
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:35,520
its fingerprint - a SHA-256 hash and a
perceptual hash - in your browser.

9
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:39,540
Only the fingerprint goes on ME Network.

10
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:44,760
Anyone in the world can verify it - when
it was registered, and by whom.

11
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:50,234
No wallet needed, no account needed.

12
00:00:50,394 --> 00:00:53,648
Here is OriginProof, open in Chrome.

13
00:00:53,808 --> 00:00:55,950
I simply upload my file.

14
00:00:56,110 --> 00:00:57,920
Now, I have this image,

15
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,316
related to it.

16
00:00:59,476 --> 00:01:01,788
I have uploaded it here.

17
00:01:01,948 --> 00:01:04,300
You can give it any title.

18
00:01:07,230 --> 00:01:09,161
Now I paste my ME ID.

19
00:01:09,321 --> 00:01:15,562
This is for a verified MetaEarth user -
otherwise you can skip it.

20
00:01:15,722 --> 00:01:21,867
I am a verified MetaEarth user, so I have
pasted my MetaEarth ID.

21
00:01:22,027 --> 00:01:26,257
You can also add an invisible watermark
here.

22
00:01:26,417 --> 00:01:29,784
I enable it, and then I register it.

23
00:01:29,944 --> 00:01:37,030
As I click Register, you can see our
registration is being sent to the network.

24
00:01:37,110 --> 00:01:41,574
Here we have our MetaMask pop-up for
verification.

25
00:01:41,734 --> 00:01:47,380
We review the alert here, acknowledge it,
and confirm it again.

26
00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:52,095
As you can see, our transaction is being
processed.

27
00:01:52,255 --> 00:01:56,570
As you can see, our transaction has been
confirmed.

28
00:01:56,650 --> 00:01:59,260
And we have got its proof here.

29
00:02:00,540 --> 00:02:03,640
We have also got the proof of MetaEarth.

30
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:11,039
We have our evidence, and our evidence has
been downloaded.

31
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:14,592
You can check the title of our image here.

32
00:02:14,752 --> 00:02:20,708
This is its fingerprint, the uploader's ME
ID - which is my MetaEarth ID.

33
00:02:20,868 --> 00:02:24,674
After this, the registration date is also
here.

34
00:02:24,834 --> 00:02:27,318
It was registered at this time.

35
00:02:27,478 --> 00:02:28,886
Let us close this.

36
00:02:29,046 --> 00:02:31,380
This is how we come here to verify.

37
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:35,394
We simply come here to verify.

38
00:02:35,554 --> 00:02:40,537
As we have verified, we have got COPY -
already registered.

39
00:02:40,697 --> 00:02:43,106
We had already registered it.

40
00:02:43,266 --> 00:02:48,764
The verified owner has also come here -
which is my MetaEarth ID.

41
00:02:48,924 --> 00:02:53,993
Now, I will verify here - here we have
this unrelated image.

42
00:02:54,153 --> 00:02:56,475
We have not verified it yet.

43
00:02:56,635 --> 00:02:57,620
We verify it here,

44
00:02:57,700 --> 00:02:59,730
and here we have NOT FOUND.

45
00:02:59,890 --> 00:03:03,250
This means we do not have it on this
system.

46
00:03:03,410 --> 00:03:07,785
In this way, we can register any image
that we have here.

47
00:03:07,945 --> 00:03:12,476
The person who registers it first will
save it as evidence.

48
00:03:12,636 --> 00:03:15,527
Let us suppose there is an image here.

49
00:03:15,687 --> 00:03:18,264
If we verify it, who is the owner?

50
00:03:18,424 --> 00:03:21,861
Sometimes people crop it and then re-post
it.

51
00:03:22,021 --> 00:03:23,661
We can verify it here.

52
00:03:23,821 --> 00:03:25,461
We will check it here.

53
00:03:25,621 --> 00:03:27,400
Let us see what is in this image.

54
00:03:27,980 --> 00:03:29,472
It is its edited version.

55
00:03:29,632 --> 00:03:32,240
I simply upload it here and click on
Verify.

56
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:41,479
As you can see, we have got a
near-duplicate - 77% similar.

57
00:03:41,639 --> 00:03:43,779
I just cropped it.

58
00:03:43,939 --> 00:03:46,660
We can verify it easily.

59
00:03:48,460 --> 00:03:51,841
Now let us come to the simple question:
how does it work?

60
00:03:52,001 --> 00:03:53,420
To understand its working,

61
00:03:54,860 --> 00:03:56,920
we first upload an image.

62
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:59,107
We have a fingerprint.

63
00:03:59,267 --> 00:04:02,280
It goes to ME Network and it becomes
secure.

64
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:08,720
Fingerprints, perceptual hash, ME ID, and
C2PA manifest hash are stored.

65
00:04:09,820 --> 00:04:14,824
The front-end is a pure static website - a
pure static site.

66
00:04:14,984 --> 00:04:18,887
There is no server, no database, no build
step.

67
00:04:19,047 --> 00:04:22,611
All sensitive work happens in your
browser.

68
00:04:22,771 --> 00:04:26,589
The file we uploaded never leaves your
device.

69
00:04:26,749 --> 00:04:29,889
Your private keys never touch the app.

70
00:04:30,049 --> 00:04:34,037
OriginProof proves that we can verify any
image.

71
00:04:34,197 --> 00:04:35,981
We can upload it here.

72
00:04:36,141 --> 00:04:39,060
We have got the certificate of this image.

73
00:04:39,780 --> 00:04:41,206
What is the image owner?

74
00:04:41,366 --> 00:04:42,981
This is our verified owner.

75
00:04:43,141 --> 00:04:44,693
This is the owner's ME ID.

76
00:04:44,853 --> 00:04:47,860
In this way, we can verify any image on
the internet.

77
00:04:49,340 --> 00:04:50,241
This is the owner.

78
00:04:50,401 --> 00:04:52,775
This is the first person who has uploaded
it.

79
00:04:52,935 --> 00:04:53,240
Thank you.

